    "body": "This adds qmlls6 as an option in nvim-lspconfig, this is different from normal qmlls as some distros like arch have a seperate package with a cmd of qmlls6 while other distros like nixos have a cmd of qmlls",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-11T12:02:54Z",
