            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "the fix is a 1 liner, so let's mention it. that actually is shorter than trying to describe it in english...\n\nplease confirm that the fix works for you\n\n    vim.config('qmlls', { cmd = { 'qmlls6' } }",
